<title>PORTUGAL: Trade on Lisbon bourse resumes.</title>
<headline>Trade on Lisbon bourse resumes.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on Lisbon bourse resumed after a brief interruption due to technical problems, a bourse official said.</p>
